&_nc_oc=Adp2lpTV5Yh2f3s54_hyxyHQA-W_tPGx1SynflFi9EYd9OT6NXCOst-IK0EyOyrO0yQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDGiLu7SvtoounBXoMvgz6raFlfnxiHQ_-YY2u6qt4pVQ&oe=6A4D183E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zrmtdh5Mp9kQ7kNvwFRcMgQ&_nc_oc=Adq-IWw8Is5tA5Gb-P5sRFkjHULV5bfgeEdjV7Z5v4vAbyvr2wlxniI8Yh22Pa9DZZk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDOWMKk-CYpDbJkEk5Gw2eZ9kOKbBzG0LuzHr_XyjCVZw&oe=6A4CF0FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O4gzS-5nDWYQ7kNvwFx4Mze&_nc_oc=Ado_ojVmbBPO32FoMo8TZ5Aez7cYs4LXeMdl2VxqiKZugB8K8jp08SNwKl2tir5NcOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDCNoo2sy1gIWNVozLACZAkBMZQGaF_9BcInJCbcYDY4w&oe=6A4D0F87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YBmHZhnyvHgQ7kNvwFJ04Fo&_nc_oc=AdqiuycHALNP2D9HFgldtMZvq7_rvjw2s8idmJomTry_AxwZVB7Xly3ocszLnCWs1DY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBHSbLNsoyjRS9KY2s9uLiw5qVa6VxcXdekYpoYOqoasg&oe=6A4CFB55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KNmrf8zFwOAQ7kNvwEb0rc7&_nc_oc=Ado9cIiAz7QcqmzSU50sR3OgxdJvV37d9YXpkjDfwd3ev4shDrrB9ev-6uOmwZ9orSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAwimkjzIGAm8jCTGWTxnkoFcTTrjXFarBlXbw9b60KkQ&oe=6A4D07E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.